      "question": "Please find and follow our team’s refund procedure for order R-1042. What should I tell the customer?",
      "answer": "I followed the team's refund-review procedure for R-1042. The review is complete, and the result is that the refund is eligible but needs manual review before it can go ahead.\n\n**What I found**\n- **Order:** € 75,00, unopened, delivered 9 days ago, under policy `standard-eu`.\n- **Policy:** 30-day return window, unopened items only, manual review required above € 50,00.\n- **Eligibility:** The order is eligible. It is inside the window (9 of 30 days) and the condition matches.\n- **Manual review:** The amount of € 75,00 is above the € 50,00 threshold, so a team member has to approve it.\n\nA review never issues a refund, and I haven't issued one.\n\n**What to tell the customer**\n\n> Hi, thanks for getting in touch about order R-1042. Your return is within our 30-day window and the item is in an eligible condition, so you qualify for a refund of € 75,00. Because of the order value, a colleague needs to complete a quick final check before we process it. We'll update you as soon as that's done. If you have any questions in the meantime, just reply to this message.\n\nPlease don't promise a refund date or say the refund is approved until the manual review has been done.",
