      "answer": "**Recommendation for R-1042: eligible for a refund, but it needs manual review before anything is issued.**\n\n**What I checked** (following the `refund-review` procedure):\n- **Order:** € 75,00 paid, delivered 9 days ago, item unopened, policy `standard-eu`.\n- **Policy `standard-eu`:** 30-day return window, unopened items accepted, manual review required above € 50,00.\n- **Window:** 9 days is inside the 30-day window.\n- **Condition:** unopened matches the accepted condition.\n- **Amount:** € 75,00 is above the € 50,00 threshold, so a person has to approve it.\n\nThis review is read-only and has not issued a refund.\n\n**What to tell the customer:**\n\n> Thank you for getting in touch about order R-1042. Your return is within our 30-day return window and the item qualifies as unopened, so it is eligible for a refund of € 75,00. Because of the order value, a colleague needs to review and approve it first. We'll confirm the outcome and the timing of the refund as soon as that's done.\n\nDon't promise a specific refund date until the manual review is approved.",
